678w|n|The coming into life or into the world; birth; also, the circumstances attending birth, as time, place, manner, etc. ; A picture representing or symbolizing the early infancy of Christ. The simplest form is the babe in a rude cradle, and the heads of an ox and an ass to express the stable in which he was born. ; A representation of the positions of the heavenly bodies as the moment of one's birth, supposed to indicate his future destinies; a horoscope.	a:58xw,98,6;5qdq,60,3~58xw,98,6;5qdq,60,3	v:58xw,82,2;5qdq,65,4~5qdq,65,4;58xw,82,2	V:28n,40,2;5of1,15,4~5of1,15,4;28n,40,2	n:rn5,107,6;1hyu,77,3;11a,3,7;alxf,3,1~11a,3,7;rn5,107,6;1hyu,77,3;alxf,3,1	N:2ctp,124,3;8bfw,97,22;8beu,85,41;93yg,78,10;28n,72,18;93zz,66,18;66xi,62,1;1mm0,58,7;253,38,8;36dg,28,2;8ipk,1,5~8beu,85,41;8bfw,97,22;93zz,66,18;28n,72,18;93yg,78,10;253,38,8;1mm0,58,7;8ipk,1,5;2ctp,124,3;36dg,28,2;66xi,62,1
